    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_1yqmvn5">
      <bpmn:text>FHIR input:
MedicationStatement
prior COPD medication

Modeling gap:
therapy-naive must be operationalized

FHIR output:
therapyNaive = true/false</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_1h3olwl">
      <bpmn:text>FHIR ActivityDefinition:
Initial bronchodilator therapy

