MedicationRequest
LAMA or LAMA + LABA</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_1jtn2ns">
      <bpmn:text>Modeling gap:
Check is required before escalation,
